(
    title: "Miniature Golf",
    developer: Some("Tom Reuterdahl"),
    description: Some("Nine holes of crazy golf with moving obstacles, and an unusual way of taking a shot: the club sits on top of the ball, and you drag it away before firing — the farther back you pull it, the harder the ball is struck. The club creeps slowly when it is near the ball, so short putts can be aimed precisely."),
